<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Moments</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Vacations</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Days</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">5JL5EnTvzxPowDaDGrBbFr</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.889" end="00:20.889">Lying down, time always seems to slip around you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.889" end="00:30.889">Waiting for the day, that you become someone brand new</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.843" end="00:39.067">Moments, idle past by the hour</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.067" end="00:43.148">In comfort, you don't mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.148" end="00:48.253">All things seem to go, to and from</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.253" end="00:56.253">As if you don't even know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.794" end="01:33.794">If you're too slow, you won't catch up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.484" end="01:42.484">I hate to say it now, but I need to interrupt</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.713" end="01:50.640">Moments, idle past by the hour</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.640" end="01:55.159">In comfort, you don't mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.159" end="02:00.284">All things seem to go, to and from</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.284" end="02:04.284">As if you don't even know</p></div></body></tt>